WEBVTT

00:11:59.923 --> 00:12:02.634
that will pull me in deeper,
the more I move through it.

00:12:03.761 --> 00:12:06.305
So I fight to believe in people,

00:12:06.305 --> 00:12:07.765
not because it feels good,

00:12:07.806 --> 00:12:09.683
but because stories matter,

00:12:09.725 --> 00:12:11.977
and we're telling ours
all the time, together.

00:12:13.187 --> 00:12:14.772
We all get stuck in quicksand --

00:12:14.813 --> 00:12:16.190
sometimes, that's OK.

00:12:16.607 --> 00:12:18.984
But the next time
you manage to pull yourself out,

00:12:18.984 --> 00:12:20.778
and find some faith in humanity,

00:12:20.819 --> 00:12:23.989
try to remember to reach back
and grab someone else who's stuck,

00:12:24.031 --> 00:12:26.909
until more of us
can make it to solid ground.

00:12:26.909 --> 00:12:29.578
Because optimism
is not a relic of the past.